2. **Open-ended Questions**: Include a mix of multiple-choice questions and open-ended questions that allow respondents to provide detailed, qualitative feedback. For example, "What changes would you suggest to improve the productivity of our team meetings?" encourages respondents to think critically and provide actionable suggestions.

